First Day — 80s Cel Anime style test

Picture: all drawings, characters, backgrounds and effects generated by code in this folder (Canvas 2D + WebGL post pass).
Rendering approach and some drawing helpers (cel.js, post.js; head/eye construction in head.js) adapted from the
Lemo-Opuscar "80s Cel Anime" style library (see the library's LICENSE).

Voice track: audio/test_audio.wav supplied by the production (not part of this folder's work).

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1):
- Baloo Bhaijaan 2 — Ek Type (Arabic subtitles), via the production's fonts/ folder
- Fredoka, Lilita One, Lalezar — via the production's fonts/ folder (loaded, not all used on screen)
- Barlow Semi Condensed — Jeremy Tribby (English subtitles, plaque), fonts/OFL-BarlowSemiCondensed.txt (from @fontsource/barlow-semi-condensed)
- Kanit — Cadson Demak (school sign), fonts/OFL-Kanit.txt (from @fontsource/kanit)

No logos, brands, real people or real landmarks: the clock tower, bus and school are generic inventions.
